24-02-28T08:40:10.75"},{"Id":"SGX1","Name":"Steven George Xiarhos","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/SGX1","ResponseDate":"2024-02-14T15:34:04.8766667"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S2555/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Mr. Collins, a petition (accompanied by bill, Senate, No. 2555) (subject to Joint Rule 12) of Nick Collins for legislation to prevent overdoses in the commonwealth.  Mental Health, Substance Use and Recovery.","DocumentText":"\tChapter 112 of the General Laws is hereby amended by inserting after section 39J the following section:-\r\n\tSection 39K. A retail pharmacy licensed pursuant to section 39 shall notify the department of public health if their supply of naloxone nasal spray is insufficient.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Suspend Rules","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J40","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J40"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J18","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J18"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Adverse","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J24","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J24"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}